## CURRENT STATE

- `frontend/` + `backend/` remain the served product. The public `frontend-next/`
  beta is separate and is not the Phase 13 cutover.
- D3 COMPLETE is CLOSED. PR `#96` merged into `main` as
  `de166e247422ec033efea584b10324ed4aa7d39e`; post-merge CI run `33002664939`
  finished `success`; production migration `20260826130000 d3b_cellar_accounting`
  is applied exactly once. D1, D2, D3-A, D3-B and D5 are closed on `origin/main`.
- D4 VERIFY & SHIP is active on branch `d4-age-legal-complete`, whose baseline
  and merge-base is `de166e247422ec033efea584b10324ed4aa7d39e`.
- The overloaded `"sconosciuto"` age value is gone. `StatoEta` is five explicit
  states — `nessuna_sessione`, `in_verifica`, `da_completare`, `completo`,
  `errore_lettura` — derived by the pure `statoEtaProfilo()` in
  `real-auth-domain.ts` from one complete `profiles` row per attempt. A read
  failure is its own state and never collapses into missing DOB.
- `AgeGate` lets guests through, covers protected content while verification is
  pending, redirects only a verified missing-DOB session to
  `/completa-profilo?next=<safe pathname>`, and fails closed on a read failure
  with `Non riusciamo a verificare il tuo profilo.`, `Riprova` and `Esci`. It
  performs no profile query of its own and prints no provider error text.
  `/legale`, `/accedi`, `/registrati`, `/auth` and `/completa-profilo` bypass it.
- Retry is `authRicaricaProfilo()` in the auth domain over `ProfileService`:
  one request per press, no second request while one is in flight, the previous
  outcome replaced by the new pending state, and responses belonging to a
  previous session discarded by user-id and request-token checks. Successful
  profile writes are guarded the same way.
- Redirects reuse only the D5 contract, `PARAMETRO_NEXT` +
  `percorsoRelativoSicuro`. The `/cantina` → `/completa-profilo?next=%2Fcantina`
  → `/cantina` round trip is covered; absolute, protocol-relative and
  backslash destinations fall back to `/home`. No second validation contract
  was introduced.
- `/completa-profilo` reads `next` through `useSearchParams` under `Suspense`,
  returns to the validated destination after a successful save, uses safe `next`
  for the already-complete CTA, shows dedicated loading and read-failure states
  instead of the form, and keeps username + DOB + 18+ declaration + logout in
  exactly one profile write.
- `/legale` is a new public Legal Hub titled `Centro legale` with `#termini`,
  `#privacy` and `#eta`. Terms and Privacy carry only
  `Il testo definitivo sarà pubblicato prima del lancio pubblico.`; the age
  section states only adults-only, self-declared DOB and no documents in this
  phase. No clause, legal basis, retention period, liability, governing law or
  identity/KYC claim was written. `Layout.tsx` adds a footer link only; primary
  and mobile navigation are unchanged.
- `/registrati` and `/completa-profilo` link Terms and Privacy to the hub.
  `ConsentCheckbox` no longer wraps its content in a `<label>` and binds the
  text with `aria-labelledby`, so following a legal link cannot toggle consent.
  Google OAuth click semantics, checkbox set and consent persistence are
  unchanged; no consent timestamp or version was added. No document upload.
- The server boundary is untouched: the `profiles.dob` CHECK and
  `public.utente_maggiorenne()` remain the authoritative barrier. No migration,
  schema, RPC, RLS or Storage change was made, and none was found to be needed.
- Bun 1.3.14 verification on the branch: D4 plus auth/redirect/public-surface
  contracts **97 pass / 0 fail / 344 expect() calls across 6 files**; the one
  full `frontend-next` suite measured **1072 tests** and exposed two source
  contract failures that were corrected; their focused rerun is **58 pass / 0
  fail**. The CI floor and its prelaunch contract are now **1072**. `bun run
  typecheck` passes and `git diff --check` is clean. No local full lint, full
  build, backend, payout, DB grid or production audit was run.
- The unrelated `.wslconfig`, `.d3b-production-schema.sql`, stashes and other
  worktrees remain untouched. No production write and no fixture was created.

